{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "046chr_306_2_3_046_06_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:5fb3d4c91f3d1e2b097ce5c5b617d8dfc0689cd1740fb3f82fa22d75c95eba1a",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:046chr_306_2_3_046_06_09_a:2_3_046_06_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:97cb88ad62b6c5ddcc8cc436547fd4fba97ab91b7c4fa88bbe4746194e4be198",
      "text": "辛苦了，●●●●プロデューサー。\n突然打电话给您，非常抱歉。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:046chr_306_2_3_046_06_09_a:2_3_046_06_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e13ea1da7c165cc097e56b08eaa0505ef1c7bfe1a6b2d604c9e470cdfbfec77",
      "text": "……关于这次的工作，\n我想向您表达感谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:046chr_306_2_3_046_06_09_a:2_3_046_06_09_a:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d5ad6898ff4b900b51e2110690311ac2eed9f01c6197e61cecb58f487e9a3a29",
      "text": "说实话，起初我心中确实充满不安。又是担任手表的模特，又是出演电视广告，被托付了如此繁重的重任。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:046chr_306_2_3_046_06_09_a:2_3_046_06_09_a:cmd-000012:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:148a348248d6940992e94676f093247ab6426251bb45595ff90cece37ca36776",
      "text": "但是，现在的我……充满信心，\n确信自己出色地完成了使命。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:046chr_306_2_3_046_06_09_a:2_3_046_06_09_a:cmd-000014:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:241ed3324aebbd4d20fef9de55c3f39d8b8771af1a8d1543d1e49a641dfa7eec",
      "text": "正是因为作为偶像积累了形形色色的经验并有所成长，才能斩获如今这般成果吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:046chr_306_2_3_046_06_09_a:2_3_046_06_09_a:cmd-000016:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:58d4e8addcc963b10331995e0dd3011f105758ed9c47c6bf8a8d430f21d5c0d0",
      "text": "制作人，一直以来真的非常感谢您。\n感谢您赋予了我如此丰厚的经验与机遇。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:046chr_306_2_3_046_06_09_a:2_3_046_06_09_a:cmd-000018:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:59c554ee61a4988a1295c344ca067611c911c49252c3fc80746c42e00c3c5ed1",
      "text": "这都是克里斯先生\n努力的成果！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:046chr_306_2_3_046_06_09_a:2_3_046_06_09_a:cmd-000021:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:497fcee7a9fb27a4cd5c978d697b9a25722420ec7634748d19683864b5a7adcd",
      "text": "谢谢您……！\n能听到您这么说，我深感荣幸。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:046chr_306_2_3_046_06_09_a:2_3_046_06_09_a:cmd-000023:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d0ded863493b62a80de7f7addc465e4f5fd099251478667af3f0870f456922f4",
      "text": "这段经验，在向大家传达大海的魅力时，\n也必定能够派上用场。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:046chr_306_2_3_046_06_09_a:2_3_046_06_09_a:cmd-000025:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2894bb0b4dc4d8c6d1d34b8ebd20ac3a6720af177fcd82d77ef0c7549f6684dd",
      "text": "今后为了将大海的魅力广泛传播至全世界，\n让我们一同努力吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
